(5783786, 841825, 65592, '<td valign="top">My favorite for the blue. Love the bird pose. The wonderful bokeh makes the bird pop up. Into my favs.</td>', 'My favorite for the blue. Love the bird pose. The wonderful bokeh makes the bird pop up. Into my favs.', '2009-12-28 10:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5783793, 841326, 65592, '<td valign="top">Great shot, although i think that maybe you could improve it (just my opinion):<br/>-The subject is too much off-centered<br/>-The background is a little distracting, maybe another aperture or adding a TC could help to isolate the bird, but i understand that maybe it was not possible on the field.<br/>-Rotate a little the image. The bird seems tilted.<br/> <br/>Congrats on this wonderful picture.8</td>', 'Great shot, although i think that maybe you could improve it (just my opinion):-The subject is too much off-centered-The background is a little distracting, maybe another aperture or adding a TC could help to isolate the bird, but i understand that maybe it was not possible on the field.-Rotate a little the image. The bird seems tilted. Congrats on this wonderful picture.8', '2009-12-28 10:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
