(5785181, 841824, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great that your whites are not blown out. Nice pose. The point of focus needs to be just an inch or so forward and then this would be perfect!</td>', 'Great that your whites are not blown out. Nice pose. The point of focus needs to be just an inch or so forward and then this would be perfect!', '2009-12-29 10:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
