(5785411, 841986, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like the way the feet stand out, and the few wee drops of water the way they catch the light.</td>', 'I quite like the way the feet stand out, and the few wee drops of water the way they catch the light.', '2009-12-29 13:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5785414, 841801, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite nicely captured and a very pretty specimen.  I like how the grain makes this seem like a print.</td>', 'Quite nicely captured and a very pretty specimen.  I like how the grain makes this seem like a print.', '2009-12-29 13:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5785416, 841818, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a cute little thing!  I like the rather shy pose you captured.</td>', 'What a cute little thing!  I like the rather shy pose you captured.', '2009-12-29 13:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5785427, 841578, 65234, '<td valign="top">Unusual perspective!</td>', 'Unusual perspective!', '2009-12-29 14:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5785430, 841885, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene and I do like the long reflections of the trees, but for this challenge I''d like to see more detail on the birds.</td>', 'Pretty scene and I do like the long reflections of the trees, but for this challenge I''d like to see more detail on the birds.', '2009-12-29 14:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5785432, 841986, 65234, '<td valign="top">I love these little guys with their big eyes.  And they''re quick, so nice job capturing this one.  Torn between liking the water drops on the branches and wanting a tighter crop on the bird to make it more portrait-y ... think for this challenge I''d prefer a tighter crop.  Maybe only keep a couple of drops and crop tighter bottom and left.</td>', 'I love these little guys with their big eyes.  And they''re quick, so nice job capturing this one.  Torn between liking the water drops on the branches and wanting a tighter crop on the bird to make it more portrait-y ... think for this challenge I''d prefer a tighter crop.  Maybe only keep a couple of drops and crop tighter bottom and left.', '2009-12-29 14:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5785433, 841484, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the fact that you caught a sailboat in the background to balance the shot.  Nice.</td>', 'Like the fact that you caught a sailboat in the background to balance the shot.  Nice.', '2009-12-29 14:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5785436, 841869, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and he''s looking right at me!  Might like it better without the foreground branches but it''s a natural scene and I know you have to take what you can get.</td>', 'Beautiful detail and he''s looking right at me!  Might like it better without the foreground branches but it''s a natural scene and I know you have to take what you can get.', '2009-12-29 14:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5785437, 841824, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, pretty swan :-)  Like the light for the most part, though some of the shadows are a bit pink on my screen.</td>', 'Aw, pretty swan :-)  Like the light for the most part, though some of the shadows are a bit pink on my screen.', '2009-12-29 14:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5785442, 841732, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait.  Pretty light and detail and a straight-on pose which looks quite classic.  Like the B&amp;W for this, too.</td>', 'Lovely portrait.  Pretty light and detail and a straight-on pose which looks quite classic.  Like the B&W for this, too.', '2009-12-29 14:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5785447, 841843, 65234, '<td valign="top">Mallards are common but I still think they''re pretty with those iridescent heads.  This one is showing up a little too dark on my screen to see facial detail; I''d dodge or otherwise lighten that up to better show him off.</td>', 'Mallards are common but I still think they''re pretty with those iridescent heads.  This one is showing up a little too dark on my screen to see facial detail; I''d dodge or otherwise lighten that up to better show him off.', '2009-12-29 14:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5785449, 841849, 65234, '<td valign="top">See, now I want to know what it is!!  Cute little bird; well-captured and composed.  Detail on the eye is especially lovely.</td>', 'See, now I want to know what it is!!  Cute little bird; well-captured and composed.  Detail on the eye is especially lovely.', '2009-12-29 14:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
