(5785456, 841839, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and eye contact.  Maybe a bit darker on the face and body than I''d like but looks like the top of his head was in bright sun which makes the exposure tough.</td>', 'Like the composition and eye contact.  Maybe a bit darker on the face and body than I''d like but looks like the top of his head was in bright sun which makes the exposure tough.', '2009-12-29 14:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
