(5785465, 841955, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty, especially the reflections and the bird''s shadow.  Silhouettes are not commonly what I think of as portrait-like so this is probably not going to be my favorite shot in this challenge, but it is a nice image.</td>', 'Pretty, especially the reflections and the bird''s shadow.  Silhouettes are not commonly what I think of as portrait-like so this is probably not going to be my favorite shot in this challenge, but it is a nice image.', '2009-12-29 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
