(5787090, 841942, 66384, '<td valign="top">How cute! He looks like a bathtub duckie. Nice colors and contrast.</td>', 'How cute! He looks like a bathtub duckie. Nice colors and contrast.', '2009-12-30 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787100, 841524, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice tree! Oh and there''s a bird. :) Good illustration of camouflage.</td>', 'Nice tree! Oh and there''s a bird. :) Good illustration of camouflage.', '2009-12-30 12:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787113, 841390, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice color and detail. BTW, it''s not a baby. The baby blue herons are white. Maybe he''s a teenager, since there is still a little white on his head and shoulder, but I don''t think so. He seems to be dressed in his breeding plumage. Nice portrait.</td>', 'Nice color and detail. BTW, it''s not a baby. The baby blue herons are white. Maybe he''s a teenager, since there is still a little white on his head and shoulder, but I don''t think so. He seems to be dressed in his breeding plumage. Nice portrait.', '2009-12-30 12:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787114, 841595, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the early light and that beautiful red eye. Great detail. Excellent portrait.</td>', 'Love the early light and that beautiful red eye. Great detail. Excellent portrait.', '2009-12-30 12:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787118, 841645, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the position and form. Very uplifting.</td>', 'Love the position and form. Very uplifting.', '2009-12-30 12:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787124, 841910, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you would lose anything by cropping the distracting foreground blur. I think I''d go for more of a square and crop some of the sky too. Great capture and very nice detail.</td>', 'I don''t think you would lose anything by cropping the distracting foreground blur. I think I''d go for more of a square and crop some of the sky too. Great capture and very nice detail.', '2009-12-30 12:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787127, 841779, 66384, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft. I like the silky water, but wish there was more light and sharper detail on the bird.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft. I like the silky water, but wish there was more light and sharper detail on the bird.', '2009-12-30 12:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787131, 841986, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and clarity for a very dark image. I like the atmosphere.</td>', 'Beautiful light and clarity for a very dark image. I like the atmosphere.', '2009-12-30 12:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787136, 841781, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and nice detail in the bird. I think some color adjustment would improve the image, since there seems to be just a bit of a yellow overcast.</td>', 'Nice capture and nice detail in the bird. I think some color adjustment would improve the image, since there seems to be just a bit of a yellow overcast.', '2009-12-30 12:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787147, 841856, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love this. It''s a real portrait. I get a great feel of the individual from looking into the eye. Beautiful!</td>', 'Love this. It''s a real portrait. I get a great feel of the individual from looking into the eye. Beautiful!', '2009-12-30 12:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787160, 841997, 66384, '<td valign="top">So cute. Nice capture. The bird and snow around its feet seems over-sharpened. The bird looks like glass, and there seem to be a lot of jpeg artifacts in the snow. I like the colors and composition.</td>', 'So cute. Nice capture. The bird and snow around its feet seems over-sharpened. The bird looks like glass, and there seem to be a lot of jpeg artifacts in the snow. I like the colors and composition.', '2009-12-30 12:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787161, 841507, 66384, '<td valign="top">Mercy, that looks like a cold bird. Love the colors -- the bird and surroundings matching up so well. Nice capture.</td>', 'Mercy, that looks like a cold bird. Love the colors -- the bird and surroundings matching up so well. Nice capture.', '2009-12-30 12:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787164, 841726, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice strong colors, although it looks as if the bird may be over-saturated. Some of the detail is lost, possibly because of the saturation. I really like the wing blur.</td>', 'Nice strong colors, although it looks as if the bird may be over-saturated. Some of the detail is lost, possibly because of the saturation. I really like the wing blur.', '2009-12-30 12:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787168, 841038, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the wintry feel of this photo. Lovely composition and light.</td>', 'Love the wintry feel of this photo. Lovely composition and light.', '2009-12-30 12:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787170, 841878, 66384, '<td valign="top">Perfect!! Beautiful color, composition, and focus. Great detail. What a cuty!</td>', 'Perfect!! Beautiful color, composition, and focus. Great detail. What a cuty!', '2009-12-30 12:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787172, 841871, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird. Something bothers me about the way he is tilted back -- as if the photo needs straightening. He looks off balance. Still you have an excellent capture with beautiful color and detail.</td>', 'Beautiful bird. Something bothers me about the way he is tilted back -- as if the photo needs straightening. He looks off balance. Still you have an excellent capture with beautiful color and detail.', '2009-12-30 12:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
