(5787183, 841237, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very pretty -- I love the color and diagonal composition with the reflection. I think for this composition, a deeper DOF would have been better, since I''m a little frustrated by the lack of focus on the other two ducks.</td>', 'Very pretty -- I love the color and diagonal composition with the reflection. I think for this composition, a deeper DOF would have been better, since I''m a little frustrated by the lack of focus on the other two ducks.', '2009-12-30 12:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
