(5787205, 841849, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image, and I think your border enhances it nicely. Love the color and composition.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image, and I think your border enhances it nicely. Love the color and composition.', '2009-12-30 12:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
