(5787565, 841801, 66635, '<td valign="top">I love the way the grey background complements/matches the color of the pigeon.  Is it fog?  This is a really beautiful picture.  And that''s remarkable because pigeons aren''t particularly beautiful birds.</td>', 'I love the way the grey background complements/matches the color of the pigeon.  Is it fog?  This is a really beautiful picture.  And that''s remarkable because pigeons aren''t particularly beautiful birds.', '2009-12-30 16:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787566, 841856, 66635, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I''d love to know what you did to this in post processing because it just doesn''t look natural.  I like it a lot, though.  I just noticed, however, that the horizon seems slightly slanted - higher on the right than the left.</td>', 'Awesome!  I''d love to know what you did to this in post processing because it just doesn''t look natural.  I like it a lot, though.  I just noticed, however, that the horizon seems slightly slanted - higher on the right than the left.', '2009-12-30 16:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787569, 841319, 66635, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Great color and composition.  A contender for a ribbon.  It''s a winter classic!</td>', 'Wonderful!  Great color and composition.  A contender for a ribbon.  It''s a winter classic!', '2009-12-30 16:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787570, 841084, 66635, '<td valign="top">Gotta be a ribbon here because of the skill involved.  Would love to know how you did it.  Stylistically or maybe aesthetically, I prefer the more natural pictures.  But that''s just a matter of taste; and I can clearly see that this is a masterful photo.</td>', 'Gotta be a ribbon here because of the skill involved.  Would love to know how you did it.  Stylistically or maybe aesthetically, I prefer the more natural pictures.  But that''s just a matter of taste; and I can clearly see that this is a masterful photo.', '2009-12-30 16:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787572, 841663, 66635, '<td valign="top">Great!  What a cool looking bird!  Wonderful how crisp and sharp this is against the bokah.</td>', 'Great!  What a cool looking bird!  Wonderful how crisp and sharp this is against the bokah.', '2009-12-30 16:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787575, 841417, 66635, '<td valign="top">Should be a blue ribbon!  I like how the position of his wing.  It really adds something to the shot.</td>', 'Should be a blue ribbon!  I like how the position of his wing.  It really adds something to the shot.', '2009-12-30 16:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
