(5787578, 841659, 66635, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That''s a ribbon for sure!  How did you get such a sharp shot of a bird moving toward you?!!!</td>', 'Wow!  That''s a ribbon for sure!  How did you get such a sharp shot of a bird moving toward you?!!!', '2009-12-30 16:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
