(5787587, 841716, 66635, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  The surroundings aren''t very pretty; but the bird is.  I love how perfectly you have exposed him.  It must have been very difficult not to overexpose him.  I love how you can see the outlines of the individual wing feathers on the underside of his wing.  That''s tough to do.</td>', 'Wonderful.  The surroundings aren''t very pretty; but the bird is.  I love how perfectly you have exposed him.  It must have been very difficult not to overexpose him.  I love how you can see the outlines of the individual wing feathers on the underside of his wing.  That''s tough to do.', '2009-12-30 16:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
