(5787614, 841839, 66635, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I think it would have been better if you had overexposed it a bit to bring out the details in the dark underside.  Spot metering would help for that.  Also, the face is a little blurry.</td>', 'Nice, but I think it would have been better if you had overexposed it a bit to bring out the details in the dark underside.  Spot metering would help for that.  Also, the face is a little blurry.', '2009-12-30 16:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787615, 841522, 66635, '<td valign="top">Interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.', '2009-12-30 16:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787616, 841934, 66635, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness and color.  Two critiques:  1) He''s not facing you - which I think is important; and 2) the perspective is not the best (looking up at his rear end).  It would have been better if you had been able to get on the same level as him and get a shot of him facing you.</td>', 'Nice sharpness and color.  Two critiques:  1) He''s not facing you - which I think is important; and 2) the perspective is not the best (looking up at his rear end).  It would have been better if you had been able to get on the same level as him and get a shot of him facing you.', '2009-12-30 16:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787617, 841521, 66635, '<td valign="top">The perspective (looking up at him from this sharp angle) takes away from this.  It would be better if you could see his eyes clearly.  It also looks like you used a flash; not sure if you did, though.  But the lighting looks distractingly flashish.</td>', 'The perspective (looking up at him from this sharp angle) takes away from this.  It would be better if you could see his eyes clearly.  It also looks like you used a flash; not sure if you did, though.  But the lighting looks distractingly flashish.', '2009-12-30 16:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787619, 841419, 66635, '<td valign="top">Chris?<br/> <br/>Bummer you couldn''t get a clear shot of the adult.</td>', 'Chris? Bummer you couldn''t get a clear shot of the adult.', '2009-12-30 16:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787620, 841327, 66635, '<td valign="top">I think you may have enlarged this beyond the limit of your lens/sensor.  I see color artifacts and lot''s of grain.</td>', 'I think you may have enlarged this beyond the limit of your lens/sensor.  I see color artifacts and lot''s of grain.', '2009-12-30 16:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5787622, 841826, 66635, '<td valign="top">Enlarged beyond the effective limit of your lens/sensor combo.  Too grainy/out of focus.  Great composition.</td>', 'Enlarged beyond the effective limit of your lens/sensor combo.  Too grainy/out of focus.  Great composition.', '2009-12-30 16:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
