(5788789, 841911, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and beautiful detail on his face.  These are quick little birds, so kudos on the clear capture.</td>', 'Lovely light and beautiful detail on his face.  These are quick little birds, so kudos on the clear capture.', '2009-12-31 19:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
