(5795101, 841326, 103142, '<td valign="top">haha!!! I just noticed this -- I was traveling home to Minnesota these past two weeks.<br/> <br/>Quick!! put some suet out! The love the suet with blueberries in it. The like mealworms, too, but it takes a long time for them to find the mealworms, and everything else eats them instead. But they really like suet.</td>', 'haha!!! I just noticed this -- I was traveling home to Minnesota these past two weeks. Quick!! put some suet out! The love the suet with blueberries in it. The like mealworms, too, but it takes a long time for them to find the mealworms, and everything else eats them instead. But they really like suet.', '2010-01-04 10:52:53.000000', NULL, 0),
