(5795142, 841910, 35892, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by paulbtlw:</b></div><hr/><i> Great shot - got an 8 from me (couldn''t understand the OOF foreground bit or it would have been more). Deserves better than 14th - excellent work. </i></td></tr></table>the oof foreground was the crop--to a portrait aspect tried all to get rid of it but?  edit for fat fingers<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-04 11:20:22.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by paulbtlw: Great shot - got an 8 from me (couldn''t understand the OOF foreground bit or it would have been more). Deserves better than 14th - excellent work. the oof foreground was the crop--to a portrait aspect tried all to get rid of it but?  edit for fat fingers', '2010-01-04 11:19:19.000000', '2010-01-04 11:20:22.000000', 0),
