(5795164, 841910, 19944, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I assume this was taken near the Conowingo Dam?  Is there a good viewing area up there?  I live in Bel Air and have honestly never explored Conowingo photographically.  I''m thinking that I should probably do it.</td>', 'Very nice.  I assume this was taken near the Conowingo Dam?  Is there a good viewing area up there?  I live in Bel Air and have honestly never explored Conowingo photographically.  I''m thinking that I should probably do it.', '2010-01-04 11:37:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795166, 841597, 61961, '<td valign="top"><br/>Maybe you are confusing opinions with pinions?<br/>:-p<br/> <br/>PS: for the record, I thought this was a dead bird.  Intriguing photo, however.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Maybe you are confusing opinions with pinions?:-p PS: for the record, I thought this was a dead bird.  Intriguing photo, however. ', '2010-01-04 11:38:55.000000', NULL, 0),
