(5795177, 841998, 65319, '<td valign="top">I''m disappointed not to see this one on the front page.  Absolutely amazing!  Congrats on top finish in a tight race.</td>', 'I''m disappointed not to see this one on the front page.  Absolutely amazing!  Congrats on top finish in a tight race.', '2010-01-04 11:45:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795182, 841530, 65319, '<td valign="top">I so wanted to shoot a peli for this challenge!  But, alas, they were shy this time so I had to go with a different bird!  I love the peli''s from Australia...they look so different than the ones we have in California, but just as beautiful!  This one got a 7 from me!  Well done, Enzo!  Congrats on Top 10.  Whew...what a race!</td>', 'I so wanted to shoot a peli for this challenge!  But, alas, they were shy this time so I had to go with a different bird!  I love the peli''s from Australia...they look so different than the ones we have in California, but just as beautiful!  This one got a 7 from me!  Well done, Enzo!  Congrats on Top 10.  Whew...what a race!', '2010-01-04 11:48:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795183, 841836, 30982, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous brown indeed!!  (I gave it a 7 - I loved the sentiment of it.  On a cold winter night, or in a tent in the woods, hand shadows are wild in their own way, you know?)  Congrats!</td>', 'A gorgeous brown indeed!!  (I gave it a 7 - I loved the sentiment of it.  On a cold winter night, or in a tent in the woods, hand shadows are wild in their own way, you know?)  Congrats!', '2010-01-04 11:48:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795186, 841659, 65319, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a very well-deserved ribbon!  WOW!</td>', 'Congrats on a very well-deserved ribbon!  WOW!', '2010-01-04 11:51:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795188, 841886, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think the saturation looks alright here.  You probably do have the reds to the right and above the bird''s eye saturated, but it doesn''t appear to blow out any detail (unless there was some there previously) and so I think it''s ok.  I think you did a good job pushing it to the edge, but not going over.</td>', 'I think the saturation looks alright here.  You probably do have the reds to the right and above the bird''s eye saturated, but it doesn''t appear to blow out any detail (unless there was some there previously) and so I think it''s ok.  I think you did a good job pushing it to the edge, but not going over.', '2010-01-04 11:52:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795193, 841858, 40718, '<td valign="top">Don''t be discouraged.  I often get disappointed that a shot doesn''t score higher when I realize how much went into the shot.  The observer doesn''t automatically realize this aspect of a shot.<br/> <br/>Probably people were responding to the lack of "individual feather detail".  Not that that is bad, but my guess is it was what people wanted to see.</td>', 'Don''t be discouraged.  I often get disappointed that a shot doesn''t score higher when I realize how much went into the shot.  The observer doesn''t automatically realize this aspect of a shot. Probably people were responding to the lack of "individual feather detail".  Not that that is bad, but my guess is it was what people wanted to see.', '2010-01-04 11:55:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795199, 841663, 65319, '<td valign="top">Well, he''s quite beautiful and lovely detail.  7 from me!  Congrats on Top 5, Jason.</td>', 'Well, he''s quite beautiful and lovely detail.  7 from me!  Congrats on Top 5, Jason.', '2010-01-04 12:00:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795202, 841888, 65319, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised to see where this one landed!  I gave this one an 8.  Well done!</td>', 'I''m surprised to see where this one landed!  I gave this one an 8.  Well done!', '2010-01-04 12:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795205, 841716, 42013, '<td valign="top">Even 7 Mae! Great finish and congrats on top 10!</td>', 'Even 7 Mae! Great finish and congrats on top 10!', '2010-01-04 12:09:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795232, 841858, 67152, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully composed and delivered image.  I think it is outstanding and can testify to the difficulty of getting a shot like this.  The title is ''on the money'' and this so fit the challenge perfectly.<br/> <br/>That said, I agree with Jason''s comments about the details on the bird - I think people were ''wowed'' by the details that some were able to capture.  I think you may have also overdid a bit of your processing as I see a bit of halo around the bird as well.  <br/> <br/>It is important to remember (and I always have to remind myself as well!) that it is not about the difficulty of the shot, but on what is delivered.   An analogy that I like to think about is that I don''t want to watch a musician play something that sounds like it is difficult to play, but rather I want to watch a musician play something effortlessly (even if the piece is difficult).<br/> <br/>Overall, I think those that stopped by long enough to ponder realized what a solid shot it was (6.9 from commenters).<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wonderfully composed and delivered image.  I think it is outstanding and can testify to the difficulty of getting a shot like this.  The title is ''on the money'' and this so fit the challenge perfectly. That said, I agree with Jason''s comments about the details on the bird - I think people were ''wowed'' by the details that some were able to capture.  I think you may have also overdid a bit of your processing as I see a bit of halo around the bird as well.   It is important to remember (and I always have to remind myself as well!) that it is not about the difficulty of the shot, but on what is delivered.   An analogy that I like to think about is that I don''t want to watch a musician play something that sounds like it is difficult to play, but rather I want to watch a musician play something effortlessly (even if the piece is difficult). Overall, I think those that stopped by long enough to ponder realized what a solid shot it was (6.9 from commenters). ', '2010-01-04 12:22:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795245, 841038, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is just splendid.  Wonderful work.  I love how you composed this so that the environment is an integral and important component of the shot.  The gaze of the bird is magical.</td>', 'This is just splendid.  Wonderful work.  I love how you composed this so that the environment is an integral and important component of the shot.  The gaze of the bird is magical.', '2010-01-04 12:29:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795246, 841735, 67152, '<td valign="top">Great shot - love the details and strong bright colors. These birds are just too cool.<br/> <br/>But I feel that a golf course is not a wild environment (except when Tiger Woods is around chasing young women) so therefore it gets a DNMC!</td>', 'Great shot - love the details and strong bright colors. These birds are just too cool. But I feel that a golf course is not a wild environment (except when Tiger Woods is around chasing young women) so therefore it gets a DNMC!', '2010-01-04 12:32:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795248, 841396, 67152, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job - this is just about perfect - especially the pose these little guys do.</td>', 'Fantastic job - this is just about perfect - especially the pose these little guys do.', '2010-01-04 12:33:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795253, 841084, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very cool stuff!  I love the crazy cool DOF you were able to capture to hightlight the birds face and soften the wings.  Congrats on the Blue.</td>', 'Very cool stuff!  I love the crazy cool DOF you were able to capture to hightlight the birds face and soften the wings.  Congrats on the Blue.', '2010-01-04 12:37:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795255, 841856, 74979, '<td valign="top">one of my favs this challenge!! Congrats Alicia!!<br/>Guess that beach is a good place for you!<br/>xoxox</td>', 'one of my favs this challenge!! Congrats Alicia!!Guess that beach is a good place for you!xoxox', '2010-01-04 12:37:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795257, 841084, 27770, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture, congrats of the Blue!</td>', 'Fantastic capture, congrats of the Blue!', '2010-01-04 12:38:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795261, 841911, 74979, '<td valign="top">beautifully done Janey!!<br/> <br/>nice score too!<br/>Congrats!!</td>', 'beautifully done Janey!! nice score too!Congrats!!', '2010-01-04 12:39:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795262, 841851, 27770, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot,the detail is just amazing...congrats!</td>', 'Excellent shot,the detail is just amazing...congrats!', '2010-01-04 12:39:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5795268, 841068, 88850, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your wonderful comments. I was hoping for better than 42nd but it is a personal best so I''m satisified. This was a one shot deal. After I took it this little guy was gone and I never saw him again. I even set out a feeder to entice him back but he never returned....at least when I was looking for him. Must be camera-shy.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-04 12:42:57.</i></td>', 'Thanks everyone for your wonderful comments. I was hoping for better than 42nd but it is a personal best so I''m satisified. This was a one shot deal. After I took it this little guy was gone and I never saw him again. I even set out a feeder to entice him back but he never returned....at least when I was looking for him. Must be camera-shy.', '2010-01-04 12:41:50.000000', '2010-01-04 12:42:57.000000', 0);
