(5795940, 841888, 81301, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yakatme:</b></div><hr/><i> Very sharp, perfectly focused, and great colors on this bird and background.  I would have liked to see more of the birds''s body, however, and probably a little more of the bird''s head facing the camera for more of a portrait feel than a candid type shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It was soooooooooo moving for me to see in your profile that the last time you had made a post voting comment on someone was on 12/21/09 and that was on a Red Ribbon!!!!!! <br/>so the fact that you went looking for my photo at the 43rd place and comment ONLY on this photo out of all the "Portrait of Wild Bird" is blowing me away. you have made me feel so special, you have no idea...<br/>i am really REALLY moved, it is worth any ribbon in the world! you made my 2010!!!<br/>no words, just no words... i am speechless...</td>', 'Originally posted by yakatme: Very sharp, perfectly focused, and great colors on this bird and background.  I would have liked to see more of the birds''s body, however, and probably a little more of the bird''s head facing the camera for more of a portrait feel than a candid type shot.   It was soooooooooo moving for me to see in your profile that the last time you had made a post voting comment on someone was on 12/21/09 and that was on a Red Ribbon!!!!!! so the fact that you went looking for my photo at the 43rd place and comment ONLY on this photo out of all the "Portrait of Wild Bird" is blowing me away. you have made me feel so special, you have no idea...i am really REALLY moved, it is worth any ribbon in the world! you made my 2010!!!no words, just no words... i am speechless...', '2010-01-04 19:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
